<title>USA: Clayton, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Clayton, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2.289 million of C layton, N.J., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a lowest rate of 5.10, highest price of 100.0581.</p>
</text>
